Remember these 5:
1️⃣ Deployment → shared storage
2️⃣ StatefulSet → separate storage
3️⃣ Headless service required
clusterIP: None
4️⃣ Pod names are stable
dbserver-0
dbserver-1
5️⃣ Each StatefulSet pod gets its own PVC
data-dbserver-0
data-dbserver-1

